      "parameters": {
        "content": "### DevOps MCP Enrichment Server\nExposes DevOps enrichment as MCP tools at the MCP Server Trigger endpoint (path `devops`). Any MCP client (Claude Code, an engineer's agent) can call: **search_infra_docs** (team standards from Pinecone `devops-kb`) and **get_pr_diff** (raw diff of a GitHub PR).\n\n**Auth:** None for the demo — switch to Bearer before exposing externally. **Wire-up:** OpenAI + Pinecone on search; GitHub credential on the PR-diff tool.",
